usage: profile.py [-h] [--profile {smoke,standard}] [--counts COUNTS]
                  [--max-buffered-bytes MAX_BUFFERED_BYTES]
                  [--layout {loose,packed,both}]
                  [--backend {memory,local,both}] [--file-bytes FILE_BYTES]
                  [--concurrency CONCURRENCY]
                  [--decode-workers DECODE_WORKERS]
                  [--baseline-decode-workers BASELINE_DECODE_WORKERS |
                  --match-baseline-decode-workers]
                  [--chunk-cpu-limit CHUNK_CPU_LIMIT]
                  [--baseline-chunk-cpu-limit BASELINE_CHUNK_CPU_LIMIT]
                  [--content {repeated,random,mixed,clustered}]
                  [--bounded-fixture] [--pack-window PACK_WINDOW]
                  [--repetitions REPETITIONS] [--probe-binary PROBE_BINARY]
                  [--baseline-binary BASELINE_BINARY]
                  [--cpu-affinity CPU_AFFINITY] [--no-build] --output OUTPUT

Inventory-free cold, warm, cross-root and wide-delta Git closure imports.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --profile {smoke,standard}
  --counts COUNTS
  --max-buffered-bytes MAX_BUFFERED_BYTES
  --layout {loose,packed,both}
  --backend {memory,local,both}
  --file-bytes FILE_BYTES
  --concurrency CONCURRENCY
  --decode-workers DECODE_WORKERS
  --baseline-decode-workers BASELINE_DECODE_WORKERS
  --match-baseline-decode-workers
                        use each requested decoder count for both variants
  --chunk-cpu-limit CHUNK_CPU_LIMIT
  --baseline-chunk-cpu-limit BASELINE_CHUNK_CPU_LIMIT
  --content {repeated,random,mixed,clustered}
  --bounded-fixture     stream fixture generation/readback and capture parent
                        RSS before audits
  --pack-window PACK_WINDOW
  --repetitions REPETITIONS
  --probe-binary PROBE_BINARY
  --baseline-binary BASELINE_BINARY
  --cpu-affinity CPU_AFFINITY
  --no-build
  --output OUTPUT
